{"id":"surabaya","name":"泗水","en":"Surabaya","country":"Indonesia","lat":-7.2473,"lng":112.7489,"dek":"鲨鱼与鳄鱼相争之地，如今是爪哇东端的工业与港口重镇。","history":"泗水最早见于中文记载，可追溯到13世纪初赵汝适《诸蕃志》中的“重迦庐”，元代汪大渊《岛夷志略》记作“重迦罗”，均为古名Jungala的对音。15世纪初马欢在《瀛涯胜览》中称其为“苏鲁马益”，并留下“林木蔚茂，千余家，过半华人”的记录。到了17世纪初，明代《东西洋考》仍沿用苏鲁马益之名。","culture":"泗水约有400万人口，爪哇人占多数，马都拉人与华人构成显著的少数民族。当地华人据估计超过100万，其中约六成为闽南人后裔，三成为客家人。地名“泗水”本身就承载了这层移民痕迹：一说源自爪哇语“苏腊巴亚”的鲨鱼与鳄鱼之意，华人先谐音为“泗里木”，再雅化为“泗水”；另一说则认为与福建漳州移民带来的“泗洲佛祖”信仰有关，供奉男相观音的庙宇逐渐演变为地名。","pull":"一座从沼泽与传说中长出的港城，华人记忆藏在它的名字里。","sights":[{"name":"红桥","orig":"Jembatan Merah","intro":"这座红色铁桥本身并不起眼，其价值在于四周环绕的荷兰殖民时期商业区，被称为“旧泗水”。这里是印尼保存最好的荷属东印度街区之一，沿街建筑仍保留着仓库、商行与骑楼的面貌。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Red_Bridge%2C_Surabaya%2C_2025_%2802%29.jpg/960px-Red_Bridge%2C_Surabaya%2C_2025_%2802%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":540},"src":null},{"name":"英雄纪念碑与十一月十日博物馆","orig":"Tugu Pahlawan & Museum Sepuluh November","intro":"纪念1945至1949年印尼独立战争中在泗水阵亡的将士。博物馆以1945年11月10日对荷宣战的日子命名，藏有军服、照片、立体模型及二战时期的枪械和迫击炮。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Tugu_Pahlawan_Surabaya.jpg/960px-Tugu_Pahlawan_Surabaya.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":617},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heroes_Monument"},{"name":"潜艇纪念碑","orig":"Monumen Kapal Selam (KRI Pasopati 410)","intro":"一艘苏联制造的潜艇，1952年下水，1962年起在印尼海军服役，1990年退役后作为纪念碑保存。船体被切开一段并加设楼梯，游客可进入内部参观。旁边的建筑里放映关于该艇历史的短片。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/KRI_Pasopati_%28410%29_at_Surabaya_in_2019.jpg/960px-KRI_Pasopati_%28410%29_at_Surabaya_in_2019.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":628},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KRI_Pasopati"},{"name":"苏拉马杜大桥","orig":"Jembatan Suramadu","intro":"连接爪哇岛泗水与马都拉岛邦卡兰的斜拉桥，2009年对公众开放。它是印尼第一座跨海大桥，桥面横跨马都拉海峡，从城区东北方向可远眺其桥塔与缆索轮廓。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Suramadu_Bridge_5.JPG/960px-Suramadu_Bridge_5.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":642},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suramadu_Bridge"},{"name":"泗水教育博物馆","orig":"Museum Pendidikan Surabaya","intro":"位于Genteng Kali街的一栋老建筑内，展示印尼教育制度与学校生活的演进。馆内保存了旧课本、教具与教室场景复原，对了解当地近代社会变迁有参考价值。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Ruangan_di_Museum_Pendidikan_Surabaya.jpg/960px-Ruangan_di_Museum_Pendidikan_Surabaya.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"泗水牛鼻沙拉","orig":"Rujak Cingur","intro":"泗水的标志性凉拌菜，以切片的熟牛鼻（cingur）搭配蔬菜，拌入以虾酱和花生调制的深色酱汁。口味咸甜交织，牛鼻口感弹韧。可在Genteng Durasim街的老店尝试。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Rujak_Cingur.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":767},"src":null},{"name":"泗水千层糕","orig":"Lapis legit Surabaya","intro":"印尼与马来西亚多地皆有制作的千层蛋糕，泗水版本以蛋黄、黄油和香料逐层烤制，质地紧实油润。切成薄片配茶或咖啡食用，常作为伴手礼带回。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/Spekkoek_naturel_en_pandan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":740},"src":null},{"name":"泗水黑牛肉汤","orig":"Rawon","intro":"以黑果（keluak）入汤，使牛肉汤呈现深近黑色的色泽，带有坚果与发酵香气。通常配米饭、豆芽和虾酱辣椒食用。Embong Malang街的“恶魔黑牛肉汤”是当地名店。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Rawon_Setan_II.jpg/960px-Rawon_Setan_II.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rawon"},{"name":"泗水豆腐蛋","orig":"Tahu telor","intro":"炸豆腐块淋上蛋液煎至凝固，再浇花生虾酱甜酱油汁，撒上豆芽和炸葱。口感软嫩与酥脆并存，酸咸甜味平衡。通常在晚间小摊或专门店供应。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Tahu_Telor_%2853984643346%29.jpg/960px-Tahu_Telor_%2853984643346%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":692},"src":null}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Central_Surabaya_view_taken_from_JW_Marriott_Surabaya.jpg/1280px-Central_Surabaya_view_taken_from_JW_Marriott_Surabaya.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":640},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/SCBD%2C_Jakarta.jpg/1280px-SCBD%2C_Jakarta.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853}],"outline":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[112.5921599,-7.2171272],[112.5921599,-7.223705],[112.5968698,-7.223407],[112.5988868,-7.2273451],[112.5978998,-7.2285691],[112.6018239,-7.2307165],[112.6023549,-7.2323556],[112.6046296,-7.2327304],[112.6058701,-7.2347088],[112.6061826,-7.2373443],[112.6070892,-7.2375412],[112.6062953,-7.2411866],[112.6019233,-7.2464177],[112.6064186,-7.2486155],[112.6145376,-7.2482029],[112.6142573,-7.2524083],[112.6178729,-7.2526637],[112.6171729,-7.2575595],[112.6262283,-7.2613333],[112.6293029,-7.2597226],[112.6319204,-7.2610094],[112.6328149,-7.2632976],[112.6317173,-7.2661621],[112.6316636,-7.2738248],[112.6312023,-7.2748438],[112.6263851,-7.2771904],[112.6281902,-7.2787895],[112.6266774,-7.2827271],[112.628158,-7.2853664],[112.6286401,-7.2896792],[112.6277917,-7.2907492],[112.628253,-7.295187],[112.6261027,-7.3000345],[112.6287447,-7.3014472],[112.6293998,-7.311618],[112.6366015,-7.3115023],[112.6369395,-7.3131005],[112.6492011,-7.3145899],[112.6482366,-7.3189426],[112.6508874,-7.3214015],[112.6502494,-7.3267023],[112.653707,-7.3272678],[112.6530016,-7.3303165],[112.6577504,-7.3309776],[112.6629724,-7.3399357],[112.665226,-7.3401748],[112.6649729,-7.3433029],[112.6658826,-7.343628],[112.6660167,-7.3454423],[112.6648043,-7.3451284],[112.6645692,-7.3514405],[112.6748046,-7.3513068],[112.6783599,-7.3504308],[112.6827803,-7.3475853],[112.6970672,-7.3424185],[112.7046747,-7.3